{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40101,"sections":[{"id":"script-20101","name":"原始脚本 20101","scripts":[20101],"start":0,"count":22}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:0","scriptId":20101,"text":"突如其来的战斗，让众人都有些摸不着头脑。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:1","scriptId":20101,"text":"“这是怎么回事？为什么我们会在这里？这里不是红场吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:2","scriptId":20101,"text":"“模拟体感……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:3","scriptId":20101,"text":"“恩，和正常战斗的感觉有点微弱的不同，但是从体感上来说，并没有什么异常。不过其他两个队伍好像没有和我们在一起嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":584,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:4","scriptId":20101,"text":"“看上去挺棒的吗？那么我们应该干什么呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":572,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:5","scriptId":20101,"text":"奈特莉刚说完，我们眼前就出现了一个白色身影——波西娅。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":572,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:6","scriptId":20101,"text":"“哟吼～怎么样，这套系统很棒吧～～可以模拟真实的战斗哦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":572,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:7","scriptId":20101,"text":"“那我们现在要做什么？干掉战车兽吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:8","scriptId":20101,"text":"“对～我会派遣各种战车兽往你们的位置攻击，你们主要就是击退它们，没什么难度吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:9","scriptId":20101,"text":"“还好吧，但是在这里如果受伤或者死亡的话，会有什么惩罚吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":584,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:10","scriptId":20101,"text":"“聪明～在这里战斗的损伤会造成你们精神上的疲劳，疲劳到一定程度，系统就会自动切断你们的精神回路，于是就可以回到现实了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":584,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:11","scriptId":20101,"text":"“所有的战斗数据都会被我统计，精神上的数据也会被一并扫描哟～虽然只能知道高兴，愤怒，紧张之类的初级数据。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":584,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:12","scriptId":20101,"text":"“这场地的范围有多大？我们能在这里任意行动吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:13","scriptId":20101,"text":"“没有问题，在这里的行动范围不会有任何制约，而且补给品我都随机放到各个场地中，所以不用担心弹尽粮绝的问题～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:14","scriptId":20101,"text":"“还有一个问题，我们要在这里待多久？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:15","scriptId":20101,"text":"“待到我满意为止～那么我先走咯～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:16","scriptId":20101,"text":"“啊！等等……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:17","scriptId":20101,"text":"刚想问一下其他问题时，波西娅的身躯开始渐渐变得透明，随后消失在了我们面前……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:18","scriptId":20101,"text":"“这下只能走一步算一步了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:19","scriptId":20101,"text":"“一切还是照旧，我们先找到一个适合战斗的掩体，毕竟这里太空旷，一直待在这，容易被打成筛子。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:20","scriptId":20101,"text":"佩妮指向不远处，可以看到很多战车兽在广场上徘徊。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20101:20101:21","scriptId":20101,"text":"“那就先这样吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
